# Healing a container and the higher order; the beam lands on all lower layers.
# Source: owner, chat 1 T14-T15, T44-T47, T53, T70.
LANGUAGE RSOS 0.2
WORLD inner_world
HOST person KIND human CHANNELS visual, auditory, kinesthetic, olfactory
USE HOST person
CONSENT person FOR practice, cues BY person
BASELINE person
OBJECT country KIND container
OBJECT identity KIND level
OBJECT white_dragon KIND archetype
OBJECT lion KIND archetype
PART white_dragon.light KIND light
COLOUR white_dragon.light white
HEAL country BY white_dragon.light SCOPE container
BEAM identity DIRECTION down BY lion
BALL family_sounds AS ball1 COLOUR orange
HEAL ball1 BY white_dragon.light
COMPRESS situation1, situation2, situation3 AS lion_symbol
HEAL lion_symbol SCOPE higher
OBJECT tv KIND object
ROUTE tv BY slumped -> problems ; agency -> communication_strategy
OBJECT earlier_self KIND self
RESCRIPT earlier_self WITH lion.paw WHEN tension
CUE lavender CODE "white_dragon" CHANNEL olfactory
FUTUREPACE lion_symbol SCENARIOS 3
SCHEDULE eagle_drill STATES associated, eagle DURATIONS 300, 60 PULSE 60 REPEAT 1 CHANNEL kinesthetic
